{"template": "{context}的数据为 {number}。请读出这个数：__________。", "slots": {"context": {"type": "choice", "options": ["某省人口普查", "某市年度GDP统计", "某博物馆藏品数量", "某国森林面积统计"]}, "number": {"type": "int", "min": 1000000, "max": 99999999}}, "constraints": [], "verifiable_type": "program", "solver": "def solve(context, number):
