{"template": "写出 {num} 的倒数。", "slots": {"num": {"type": "choice", "options": ["3/7", "5", "0.25", "1", "9/4", "0.8"]}}, "constraints": [], "verifiable_type": "program", "solver": "def solve(num):
    from fractions import Fraction
    # 处理输入字符串，转换为 Fraction
    if '/' in num:
        f = Fraction(num)
    elif '.' in num:
        f = Fraction(num).limit_denominator(1000)
    else:
        f = Fraction(int(num))

    # 求倒数
    if f == 0:
        return "无"
    reciprocal = Fraction(f.denominator, f.numerator)

    # 格式化输出：整数直接返回整数形式，否则返回分数形式
    if reciprocal.denominator == 1:
        return str(reciprocal.numerator)
    else:
        return f"{reciprocal.numerator}/{reciprocal.denominator}"", "answer_format": "一个数（整数或最简分数）", "solution_steps": ["识别给定数的类型（分数、整数或小数）。", "如果是小数，先将其化为分数；如果是整数，看作分母为1的分数。", "交换分子和分母的位置得到倒数。", "检查结果是否为最简分数，若是整数则去掉分母。"], "requires_reverse_thinking": false, "typical_errors": ["求小数的倒数时，未将小数化成分数直接交换位置（如认为0.25的倒数是5.0或4.0但过程错误）。", "整数的倒数写成分数后忘记化简或格式错误（如5的倒数写成1/5是对的，但有时学生会写成5/1）。", "混淆倒数与相反数的概念（如认为3/7的倒数是-3/7）。", "对于1的倒数，部分学生可能犹豫或错误地认为没有倒数或为0。"], "examples": [{"params": {"num": "3/7"}, "problem": "写出 3/7 的倒数。", "answer": "7/3", "answer_value": "7/3", "solution": "3/7 是真分数，交换分子分母位置，倒数为 7/3。"}, {"params": {"num": "5"}, "problem": "写出 5 的倒数。", "answer": "1/5", "answer_value": "1/5", "solution": "5 可以看作 5/1，交换分子分母位置，倒数为 1/5。"}, {"params": {"num": "0.25"}, "problem": "写出 0.25 的倒数。", "answer": "4", "answer_value": "4", "solution": "0.25 化为分数是 1/4，交换分子分母位置得到 4/1，即 4。"}]}

{"template": "计算：{f1} {op} {f2}", "slots": {"f1": {"type": "fraction", "min": "1/10", "max": "9/10", "max_denominator": 12}, "f2": {"type": "fraction", "min": "1/10", "max": "9/10", "max_denominator": 12}, "op": {"type": "choice", "options": ["+", "-"]}}, "constraints": ["f1.denominator != f2.denominator", "f1 > f2 if op == '-' else True"], "verifiable_type": "program", "solver": "from fractions import Fraction

