{"template": "用 {n} 个小正方形拼长方形，能拼成 {count} 种不同的长方形（长和宽交换视为同一种）。{n} 的因数有 {factors_str}。因为 {n} 只有 1 和它本身两个因数（或有其他因数），所以 {n} 是 {type}。", "slots": {"n": {"type": "int", "min": 2, "max": 50}, "count": {"type": "int", "min": 1, "max": 10}, "factors_str": {"type": "choice", "options": ["placeholder"]}, "type": {"type": "choice", "options": ["质数", "合数"]}}, "constraints": [], "verifiable_type": "program", "solver": "def solve(n):
    from math import isqrt

    # 1. 计算因数列表
    factors = []
