{"template": "判断题：某小组 {n} 名同学的数学成绩分别是 {scores_str}。小明计算出这组数据的平均数是 {candidate} 分。小明的计算结果正确吗？（    ）", "slots": {"n": {"type": "int", "min": 3, "max": 5}, "min_score": {"type": "int", "min": 60, "max": 85}, "max_score": {"type": "int", "min": 90, "max": 100}, "candidate": {"type": "decimal", "min": "50.0", "max": "110.0", "places": 1}, "scores_str": {"type": "choice", "options": ["78, 82, 90, 95", "60, 65, 70, 80, 88", "80, 85, 90", "85, 90, 95, 100", "70, 75, 80, 85, 90"]}}, "constraints": ["max_score > min_score + 5"], "verifiable_type": "program", "solver": "def solve(n, min_score, max_score, candidate, scores_str):
    try:
        scores = [Decimal(x.strip()) for x in scores_str.split(',')]
    except:
        return "×"

    actual_min = min(scores)
    actual_max = max(scores)
    cand_val = Decimal(str(candidate))

    if cand_val < actual_min or cand_val > actual_max:
        return "×"

    actual_avg = sum(scores) / len(scores)

    if actual_avg == cand_val:
